+The bundled `SDK/` is the JieLi AC707N/BR35 watch SDK. On top of it, this repository adds a
+**badge-menu application** (selected by the `MENU=1` build flag) plus the drivers and BLE features it
+needs. Everything custom compiles into the same SDK via `#ifdef CONFIG_BADGE_MENU` blocks and a few
+new source files — there is no separate app tree.
 
