+| Feature | Summary |
+|---|---|
+| Badge menu | LVGL v8 touch menu (Mouse / Scanner / Spoofing / Update / Settings) |
+| BLE HID mouse | The badge acts as a BLE-HID mouse (the touchscreen is a trackpad) |
+| BLE scanner / GATT central | Scans nearby BLE devices and lists their GATT services |
+| Device spoofing | Clones a BLE advertisement from the menu (security-research feature, on your own devices) |
+| Lock / screensaver | Boots suspended; a key wakes to a lock image, a swipe opens the menu |
+| BLE OTA | Updates the firmware over BLE from the Update screen |
 
