+## Hardware at a glance
 
+- **SoC:** JieLi AC707N (BR35 series), `pi32v2` architecture
+- **Flash:** 4 MB SPI NOR, single-bank layout
+- **Display:** round **360×360 RGB565** LCD (SPI/QSPI, ST77916-class panel)
+- **Touch:** **AXS5106L** capacitive controller (bit-banged I²C)
+- **Input:** hand-wired ADKEY buttons on PB7 (resistor divider + P33 WKUP)
+- **Debug:** UART on `/dev/ttyUSB0` @ 115200 (FTDI, **GND + RX only**)
 
